OL,3,GNEWSAMicrosoft outage disrupts hospital
OL,4,Acommunications
OL,5,
OL,6,FHospitals in the West of England are
OL,7,Fexperiencing disruption following a
OL,8,Fglobal Microsoft Outlook email outage.
OL,10,FThe technical issue has affected
OL,11,Fcommunications at NHS trusts, raising
OL,12,Fconcerns about the potential impact on
OL,13,Fappointments, enquiries and day-to-day
OL,14,Foperations.
OL,16,FThe outage is affecting services
OL,17,Fincluding Teams, Outlook and Copilot
OL,18,Facross the world. Microsoft said the
OL,19,Fcause was "elevated load" on its server
OL,20,Finfrastructure.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
