OL,3,GNEWSAMicrosoft outage disrupts hospital
OL,4,Acommunications
OL,5,
OL,6,FBristol NHS Foundation Trust reassured
OL,7,Fpatients that essential hospital
OL,8,Fservices and procedures were continuing
OL,9,Fas normal. Patients with urgent
OL,10,Fenquiries were advised to contact the
OL,11,Frelevant hospital department using the
OL,12,Fnumber on their appointment letter.
